          "md": "Full program for **Initials and reversal** (try it yourself first):\n\n```python\nname = input(\"Full name: \")\nparts = name.split(\" \")\ninitials = (parts[0][0] + parts[1][0]).upper()\nprint()\nprint(initials)\nprint(name.upper())\nprint(name[::-1])\n```\n\nOutput:\n\n```text\nFull name: \nAL\nADA LOVELACE\necalevol ada\n```"
